  "exportBannerCount": "{count} records since then. A lost phone is lost records unless you export.",
  "@exportBannerCount": {
    "description": "The count is READ, never estimated. The second sentence is the qualified form of spec 7.9's warning: 'a lost phone is lost data' UNQUALIFIED is banned (CLAUDE.md), because it is only true if they have not exported - and this banner exists precisely to make that qualification actionable.",
